    "text": "emporiamainstreet.com\nwebsite\nEmporia\nStart Your Own Business Class\n12 hours ago\nLast chance to sign up for the Start Your Own Business class is this week!. Classes begin October 13th and will be held on Monday & Thursday evenings, 6pm – 9pm. If you are serious about taking your business from concept to reality, the Start Your Own Business class is one of the best tools at your disposal!\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nGreg Wilson, CFA\n·\nuser · 19.6K followers\n8 Foods You Can Eat A Lot Of Without Gaining Weight, According to a Dietitian\nKim Yawitz, RD, is a registered dietitian and gym owner in St. Louis, Mo. In addition to coaching fitness and nutrition clients one-on-one and in small groups, Kim also shares her expertise with national media outlets. She enjoys cooking, reading, and spending time with her family.\nSt. Louis, MO ·21d",
